<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87492" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προηρόσιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄροτος</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>before the time of
			tillage</i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προηροσία</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυσία</span>), ἡ, a festival <i>at that time</i> celebrated by Athens for
			the whole of Greece, <i><span class="en">
				Hyp.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				75
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lycurg.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				87
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-όσια</span> cj. Sauppe), <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.
				1.196J.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Decl.</u>
				1.179
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				1055
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>, etc.: also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προηρόσια</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύματα</span> or
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερά</span>), τά, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1029.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰρεσιώνη</span>
			 (gen. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιων</span> in ambiguous in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1363.6
			</span></i>): sg. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προηγορ-όσιον</span></b> 
				Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				725
			</span></i>: cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πληροσία, πρηροσία.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοὶ προηρόσιοι</span> the gods <i>in
				whose honour it was performed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1119e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. Δημήτηρ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				158d
			</span></i>.</div>
